    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haa... haah...! You dodged it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well, I'll let you keep your right hand for just a little longer... Just a little longer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "(\u2014These aren't tears... It's sticky... Is it blood?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(...So much blood...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(My heart's beating way too fast... I...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 16,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pathetic. The way you swing your weapon is no better than those clowns knocking at the knightly orders' doors. It's laughable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aside from your looks, you are nothing like the Radiant Knight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I'm not going to lose!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, now I want to tear your face off even more, you naive noble prick!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
