    },
    {
        "text": "Ingra! He's chasing her like a storm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the most destructive match the Roar Arena has seen this event\u2014! The Butcher of the Field! 'Brassrust' Ingra!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just last month, at the season's first event, poor 'Foehn' got absolutely decimated when the 'Brassrust' kept pummeling him until all of his limbs were crushed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "You heard that right! He pummeled with his bare hands! That's definitely not the kind of thing you'd expect a knight carrying a giant axe to do!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "All eyes are on Maria Nearl here at the Roar Arena today, but is this also where we see her meet a bloody fate? Let us know what you in the audience think!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.5,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$livecrowd",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "loop": false,
        "channel": "people"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like that! 'Brassrust' Ingra! Smear the battlefield with your opponent's blood!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
