    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! Not a bad counter\u2014That really gives me all the more reason to tear you apart!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it'll be no fun if we end this so quickly. I'll smear your blood all over that irritating face... the Radiant Knight's face!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "We both know... you're at your limit too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah! A little blood's not going to stop me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
