    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well... I didn't expect Ingra to join the fray so soon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The National Council let him go early. Hmph, it's like the whole trial was just a sham.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like the corporation coughed up quite a bit of money for him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh huh... the Rose Paper Union's full of money anyway.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "It really pisses me off. They're raking in money manipulating public opinion, and other unscrupulous means. That commentator even dared to talk about it openly in a public event.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That just says they aren't afraid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, I mean, what do they have to be afraid of?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, they have us to be afraid of. Ingra's a bad loser, and I'll absolutely destroy him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_122",
        "name2": "avg_npc_123",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on, didn't we agree to let me fight him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before that... If the young Nearl doesn't come up with an idea soon, she won't make it out of this in one piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
