    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Her blood is still in her body! Maria Nearl is much more stubborn than any of us could've thought!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you waiting for? Doesn't a knight like her just tear at your heartstrings?! Don't forget! Thanks to the generosity of the good-hearted souls at Roar Guards Company, this season's commission fee is just half the normal rate!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Hold on! Something's happening here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "The two of them are at a standoff, but Maria's laid down her shield! What is happening here?! Is she hoping to take on Ingra's giant axe with that fragile sword of hers?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's an enormous difference in both size and power!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_121#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't emphasize this enough\u2014! Commission's half off! Isn't this act of courage worth a few dozen gold coins?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahh... haahh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_104"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Not bad, kid... A faint light envelops your blade. Is this your last gasp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ha, excellent! I'll rip your arms out, and gag you with your own flesh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brassrust Knight"
    },
    {
