    {
        "text": "I must win... I must..."
    },
    {
        "text": "What am I doing... Are you meant to kill your opponent in the knight sports?"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need my shield... I can't block his axe..."
    },
    {
        "text": "He's hurt too, but he doesn't care... He's like a monster, and he enjoys killing..."
    },
    {
        "text": "How should I... face an enemy like him... An enemy? Isn't he a knight?"
    },
    {
        "text": "A knight...?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
