    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Ahh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "O-Owww...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Came around finally?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Auntie...? What... happened...? Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Did I lose?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But Ingra passed out too. Neither of your scores changed at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I see. Phew... That's good\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not good! You're hurt!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You should've forfeited the match, going up against an opponent like that! It's just a single match! There are so many ways for us to get those points back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you just want to get a title and keep your family's nobility, there's no reason to go that far\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I never thought about forfeiting, not even once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#5",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you have any idea how lucky you are to get out of a fight against Ingra in one piece?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you get hurt again, what good does getting into the Major do to you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...He's really strong, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He's not like the other knights. He comes from an insanely well-off family, and he's only in the competition to hurt people. He lives for it. That's the kind of man Olmer Ingra is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maria, if you get hurt like this again, I won't let you fight anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "F-Fine...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move so much. Get some rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#6",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That match ended in a draw, but you'll have more and more companies trying to woo you... Marcin and I will turn them down for now. Try to rest up and get better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... What's that sword?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...That's the sword I used to carry. I dug it out while you were training the other day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But why are you carrying that sword specifically...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Even though Zofia's already...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No reason at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if something bad happens to you because of him, I'll kill him personally, even if it means I'll have to face the National Council.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-You're way overthinking it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Can I see it? It kinda looks like it hasn't been used in a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Get some rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I might start to rust if I lie in bed all day...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No dice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, Zofia! Auntie! I won't ask for anything else! I'll be good and rest up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*... You're becoming more and more like your sister...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Take it. Don't you do anything weird with it. I'm quite fond of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh... This is pretty dusty...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Maria"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_061#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_064_weapon_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the proof that I treasure it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zofia"
    },
