    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$bar_intro",
        "key": "$bar_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you two going, carrying all that stuff with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to pay Maria a visit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I will never forgive Ingra for doing that to our girl...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Spare her the noise and give her some peace and quiet. Zofia will take care of Maria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I can't just sit around and do nothing! Did you see that last swing Ingra took at her? What happens if that comes back to haunt her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got an old knight and an old craftsman here. There's bound to be something we can do to help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What if you run into M\u0142ynar instead? Do you think he won't throw you two out the door?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_107",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...That prick wouldn't dare do that to us when his old man was still around, and I know when to run if it comes to it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_107"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hmm, the moment the two of them left, I got a new customer. They just might be the albatross around my neck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome. It's been a while since we've had such a beauty in here. What can I get you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_204_platnm_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This one has a pretty name. Let's go with this one, the 'Thorn Tear.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Platinum"
    },
